    "pitfall": "기능 지원은 올바른 콘텐츠 순서나 접근성을 자동 보장하지 않습니다. 대체 레이아웃과 확장 레이아웃을 둘 다 확인하세요.",
    "css": ".recipe-demo {\\n  display: grid;\\n  gap: 16px;\\n  min-width: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.sample-row {\\n  display: flex;\\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  gap: 12px;\\n}\\n\\n.sample-card {\\n  min-width: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.sample-grid {\\n  display: grid;\\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\\n  gap: 12px;\\n}\\n\\n.sample-card {\\n  display: grid;\\n  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;\\n  padding: 16px;\\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\\n}\\n\\n@supports (grid-template-rows: subgrid) {\\n  .sample-grid {\\n    grid-auto-rows: auto;\\n  }\\n  .sample-card {\\n    grid-row: span 2;\\n    grid-template-rows: subgrid;\\n  }\\n}"
